    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2006-09-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2011-06-30"></period-end>
     <target value="Asset value of National roads &amp;gt; than in 2007.">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">A key objective of the Road Sector Program was to reverse the negative trend in  the asset value of the road network.  This hasbeen achieved, since the asset value of the networl of National roads is now higher than in 2006; it is now US$ 2.96 billion US$instead of US$ 2,29 billion.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual value="US$ 2.96 billion">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on Asset Valuation exercise carried out in May 2011.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
